    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i started taking quetiapine (seroquel) a few weeks ago for my sleep because my doctor prescribed it for my anxiety/insomnia but im still having a really hard time passing out. i was thinking about taking some melatonin or maybe some benadryl tonight to see if it helps the seroquel work better. is it okay to mix those or should i just take more seroquel?",
