      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i should call them but they're closed for the weekend and i'm really struggling right now. im not trying to do anything crazy, just want to sleep. like, how bad can it really be if i just take an extra benadryl? it's just an allergy med, it shouldn't interact that much with the seroquel, right? i just need to know if it's safe enough to try tonight so i don't spend another night staring at the ceiling.",
